OL,3,GNEWSA'My dad made monsters for the
OL,4,Amovies'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe thrilled us, scared us and even
OL,7,Feducated us with his movies about
OL,8,Fclassical heroes battling mythical
OL,9,Fcreatures.
OL,11,FNow an exhibition of special effects
OL,12,Fpioneer Ray Harryhausen's original
OL,13,Fmonster figures and artwork is on
OL,14,Fdisplay at The Arc in Winchester,
OL,15,FHampshire.
OL,17,FJason and the Argonauts, The Golden
OL,18,FVoyage of Sinbad, One Million Years
OL,19,FB.C. and Clash of the Titans all
OL,20,Ffeatured Harryhausen's monstrous
OL,21,Fhandmade creations.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
